            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>SubFuse Beta 0.10.1</title></head><body><h1>SubFuse Beta 0.10.1</h1><p>Fixes Cursor subscriptions asking you to sign in again even when the account dashboard is already signed in.</p><ul><li>Uses Cursor’s current account-check route while preserving remembered accounts and saved subscription details.</li><li>Includes one-click Claude and Cursor updates and Refresh all.</li><li>Failed refreshes preserve the last successful reading.</li></ul><p>Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 14 or later. This beta is not Apple-notarized.</p></body></html>]]></description>
